# CI 专用构建文件：基于上游 Dockerfile，增加国内 Go 代理与 Harbor 可达的基础镜像
FROM docker.m.daocloud.io/library/golang:1.27-alpine AS builder

ARG REVISION=unknown
ENV GOPROXY=https://goproxy.cn,direct \
    GOSUMDB=off \
    CGO_ENABLED=0

RUN mkdir -p /podinfo
WORKDIR /podinfo
COPY . .
RUN go mod download
RUN go build -ldflags "-s -w -X github.com/stefanprodan/podinfo/pkg/version.REVISION=${REVISION}" -a -o bin/podinfo ./cmd/podinfo/*
RUN go build -ldflags "-s -w -X github.com/stefanprodan/podinfo/pkg/version.REVISION=${REVISION}" -a -o bin/podcli ./cmd/podcli/*

FROM docker.m.daocloud.io/library/alpine:3.24
RUN addgroup -S app \
    && adduser -S -G app app \
    && apk --no-cache add ca-certificates curl netcat-openbsd

WORKDIR /home/app
COPY --from=builder /podinfo/bin/podinfo .
COPY --from=builder /podinfo/bin/podcli /usr/local/bin/podcli
COPY ./ui ./ui
RUN chown -R app:app ./

USER app
EXPOSE 9898
CMD ["./podinfo"]
